      "id": 1,
      "text": "McClellan Park sits on the former McClellan Air Force Base, which closed in 2003.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McClellan_Park%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The base once employed up to 26,000 people, making it Northern California's largest industrial facility.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mcclellanpark.com/about/history?bcsi-ac-95782208a8e11336=27C3FE9900000202NaMVTT5rKq8dxXeyBijqgZA2TDIPDwAAAgIAABOOOACEAwAAAQAAAH/CCgA="
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The former base is now a National Historic Landmark featuring wooden sidewalks and paddle wheelers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitolia.com/McClellan-Park-V102039"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "McClellan Park houses a world‑class aviation museum with over 40 historic aircraft and engaging exhibits.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
