      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitolia.com/McClellan-Park-V102039"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The park’s name honors test pilot Hezekiah McClellan, a pioneer in early flight.",
